message: "If you use Market Almanac or its published studies, please cite it as below."
title: "Market Almanac: an open research platform for food-price forecastability"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mahatekar
    given-names: Aneesh
repository-code: "https://github.com/aneesh-6220/market-almanac"
url: "https://market-almanac-app.vercel.app/"
license: MIT
version: "1.4.0"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
keywords:
  - food prices
  - forecasting
  - weather
  - WFP
  - reproducible research
  - pre-registration
abstract: >-
  Market Almanac ingests World Food Programme market prices for every country published through
  HDX HAPI, tracks their quality and coverage, and runs pre-registered, versioned forecasting
  studies with country-balanced inference, negative controls and independent audit scripts.
  Data remain under their providers' licences (see docs/DATA_SOURCES.md).
